TX-HST21.ZIP  TLX_HST.1ST

This ZIP archive contains the following files:

FILENAME       ORIGINAL SIZE    DESCRIPTION

TLX_HST  1ST     2024           This file
TLX_HST  DOC    18284           Documentation for TLX_HST and HST Modems
TLX_HST  NEW     2176           What's new in this release
TLX_HST  SLC    32540           The compiled TLX_HST script
TLX_HST? SLM      813-1131      Assorted menu files used by TLX_HST
TLX_HST  SLT    59600           Source code for the TLX_SLT script
MENU_MGR SLC     6800           Menu Manager routine used by TLX_HST

All file dates are 01/23/89.  Times are all 7:00 pm.

If the file sizes shown do not match what is in your TX-HST21.ZIP
archive, one or more files may have been modified by someone
other than the author (and did not bother to update this
TLX_HST.1ST file).

NOTE:  TLX_HST 2.1 was designed to run on an EGA or VGA display.  It
       will run under Mono or CGA but the menu's are currently not
       very pretty.  It is recommended that MONO/CGA users stick with
       the old release 1.2 until better screen support is added in
       the planned 3.0 release of TLX_HST.

The TLX_HST.SLT file is the HST SALT script source code. SALT source
is standard CR/LF-delimited ASCII files which contain the
script's programming.  You may view/edit it with any suitable
text editor or word processor which can save files in standard
ASCII format. The compiled script is called TLX_HST.SLC and is
ready to run.  If you customize the .SLT source code do not forget
to use the CS Telix command to recompile the script into executable
.SLC format.

PLEASE DO NOT Modify or rename this ZIP archive.

